/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Coinsurance is a health care cost sharing between you and your insurance company. Not all plans have coinsurance \(some have copay\). It is a split of the cost of the services - the number you see is the number the insurance company pays. You pay the remainder. )
/E (Coinsurance is a health care cost sharing between you and your insurance company. Not all plans have coinsurance \(some have copay\). It is a split of the cost of the services - the number you see is the number the insurance company pays. You pay the remainder. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
