/E (Example: Tom's plan is a Gatekeeper plan. Tom develops an extreme ear pain and needs to see an Ear, Nose, and Throat Doctor. Tom must first contact/schedule to see his Primary Care Physician, and must be referred to a specialist, before the plan will cover treatment. If Tom contacts an ENT Doctor before a referral is given, Tom will be responsible for the entire cost of the treatment, even if the ENT is In-Network and the treatment is medically necessary.)
